## Security Contract (non-negotiable)

{{ security_rules }}

**Additional test rules:**
- Auth bypass is never acceptable in tests — always use real tokens from test auth fixtures
- Never hardcode test credentials in test files — use pytest fixtures or env vars
- IDOR tests are mandatory for any endpoint that takes a resource ID: test that user A cannot access user B's resource
- Test the negative case for every permission boundary

